    "kind": "quiz",
    "variety": "goal-check",
    "prompt": "Goal: Find the button the UI shows that the server always rejects.\n\nWhich check verifies this goal?",
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "The save path calls `updateMutation.mutateAsync(payload)` (`workspace-dashboard.tsx:116`), which calls `updateDraftEntry`. That function has no status check, so the published content changes immediately.",
      "evidence": [
       "seed:quests:organized-experiment-ww45/quiz/0212f0fb5fedf1ac"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "For an **archived** entry, `status !== \"PUBLISHED\"` is true, so Publish is shown (`:185`). But `ARCHIVED -> PUBLISHED` is not in `allowedTransitions` (`src/lib/auth/permissions.ts:83-87`), so the click returns 409 \"Cannot move an entry from ARCHIVED to PUBLISHED\".",
      "evidence": [
       "seed:quests:organized-experiment-ww45/quiz/9d0db3e8adb8e167"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "`slugify(\"SECURITY\")` gives `security`, so the upsert hits the existing row and runs `update: { name: \"SECURITY\" }` (`src/repositories/tagRepository.ts:22-26`). Every entry tagged Security now shows \"SECURITY\".",
      "evidence": [
       "seed:quests:organized-experiment-ww45/quiz/e6d0bb09e8103872"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "`slug: slugify(value.slug?.length ? value.slug : value.title)` (`src/lib/validation/knowledgeEntrySchemas.ts:48`). It falls back to the title.",
      "evidence": [
       "seed:quests:organized-experiment-ww45/quiz/596bd0734a5dbe5a"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "check": {
     "type": "quiz",
     "itemKey": "seed:quests:organized-experiment-ww45/quiz/9d0db3e8adb8e167",
     "grading": "choice",
     "answerKey": 1,
     "choices": [
      "The save path calls `updateMutation.mutateAsync(payload)` (`workspace-dashboard.tsx:116`), which calls `updateDraftEntry`. That function has no status check, so the published content changes immediately.",
      "For an **archived** entry, `status !== \"PUBLISHED\"` is true, so Publish is shown (`:185`). But `ARCHIVED -> PUBLISHED` is not in `allowedTransitions` (`src/lib/auth/permissions.ts:83-87`), so the click returns 409 \"Cannot move an entry from ARCHIVED to PUBLISHED\".",
      "`slugify(\"SECURITY\")` gives `security`, so the upsert hits the existing row and runs `update: { name: \"SECURITY\" }` (`src/repositories/tagRepository.ts:22-26`). Every entry tagged Security now shows \"SECURITY\".",
      "`slug: slugify(value.slug?.length ? value.slug : value.title)` (`src/lib/validation/knowledgeEntrySchemas.ts:48`). It falls back to the title."
     ]
